# OpenFOAM logs
*.log
log.*

# OpenFOAM case viewer files
*.foam
*.OpenFOAM

# OpenFOAM generated time directories
# Keep initial condition folders named 0, but ignore generated time folders.
**/[1-9]*/
**/[0-9][0-9]*/
**/[0-9]*.[0-9]*/

# Parallel/decomposition output
**/processor*/

# Post-processing output can be large; save selected figures/summaries manually
**/postProcessing/

# Generated dynamic code
**/dynamicCode/

# OpenFOAM backup files
*~
*.bak

# System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
